Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
*.stackdump

# Linux
*~
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

