## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.10+
- Node.js 18+
- Google Gemini API Key ([Get one free](https://aistudio.google.com/apikey))
- Git

### 🔧 Backend Setup

```bash
# 1. Navigate to backend
cd backend

# 2. Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# 3. Activate it
# Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# macOS/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

# 4. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 5. Create .env file
cp .env.example .env
# Add your GEMINI_API_KEY in .env

# 6. Initialize database
python scripts/init_db.py

# 7. Seed demo data (optional)
python seed_data/seed_rules.py
python seed_data/seed_users.py

# 8. Run the server
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
Backend will run at: http://localhost:8000
API docs: http://localhost:8000/docs

🎨 Frontend Setup
bash
# 1. Navigate to frontend
cd frontend

# 2. Install dependencies
npm install

# 3. Create .env file
echo "VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000" > .env

# 4. Run dev server
npm run dev
Frontend will run at: http://localhost:5173

🔑 Environment Variables
Backend .env
env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
SECRET_KEY=your_jwt_secret_key_here
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./audit_agent.db
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
Frontend .env
env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
📡 API Endpoints
🔐 Authentication
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/auth/register	Register new user
POST	/api/auth/login	Login & get JWT token
GET	/api/auth/me	Get current user
📋 Audits
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/audits	List all audits
POST	/api/audits	Create new audit
GET	/api/audits/{id}	Get audit details
POST	/api/audits/{id}/run	Run AI audit
DELETE	/api/audits/{id}	Delete audit
📜 Compliance Rules
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/compliance/frameworks	List all frameworks
GET	/api/compliance/rules	List all rules
GET	/api/compliance/gaps	Detected gaps
📄 Evidence
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/evidence	List evidence
POST	/api/evidence/upload	Upload evidence
GET	/api/evidence/{id}	View evidence
📊 Reports
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/reports	List all reports
POST	/api/reports/generate	Generate report
GET	/api/reports/{id}/download	Download PDF
🧠 Knowledge Graph
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/kg/nodes	Get all nodes
GET	/api/kg/edges	Get all edges
GET	/api/kg/graph	Full graph data
📈 Dashboard
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/dashboard/stats	Overall stats
GET	/api/dashboard/trends	Compliance trends
🎯 How It Works
text
┌─────────────────┐
│  User Uploads   │
│  Policy / Logs  │
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  NLP Processing     │  ← Extract entities, text
│  (spaCy)            │
└────────┬────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Gemini AI Analysis │  ← Find compliance gaps
│  + Rule Engine      │
└────────┬────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Knowledge Graph    │  ← Map relationships
│  (NetworkX)         │
└────────┬────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Evidence Generator │  ← Auto-generate proof
└────────┬────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Report Generator   │  ← Final PDF/HTML
└─────────────────────┘
